💬 3. Conversational RetrievalQA

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 What is Conversational RetrievalQA?

```text id="retrievalqa_def"
A conversational RAG system that combines retrieval with chat memory
```

---

🔄 Workflow

```text id="retrievalqa_flow"
User Question → Retriever → Relevant Chunks
Previous Chat History + Context → LLM → Answer
```

---

🔹 Why It’s Powerful

Instead of treating every question independently:

👉 The system remembers conversation context.

---

📌 Example Conversation

User:

```text id="conversation_ex1"
"What is machine learning?"
```

Later:

```text id="conversation_ex2"
"What are its applications?"
```

👉 The model understands "its" refers to machine learning.

---

💻 Example: Conversational RetrievalQA

```python id="retrievalqa_code"
from langchain.chains import ConversationalRetrievalChain
from langchain.memory import ConversationBufferMemory

memory = ConversationBufferMemory(
    memory_key="chat_history",
    return_messages=True
)

qa_chain = ConversationalRetrievalChain.from_llm(
    llm=llm,
    retriever=retriever,
    memory=memory
)
```

---

⚔️ RetrievalQA vs Conversational RetrievalQA

| Feature                  | RetrievalQA | Conversational RetrievalQA |
| ------------------------ | ----------- | -------------------------- |
| Chat History             | ❌ No        | ✅ Yes                      |
| Context Awareness        | Low         | High                       |
| Multi-turn Conversations | ❌ No        | ✅ Yes                      |

---

🚀 Real-World Applications

✔ Customer support chatbots
✔ AI tutors
✔ Enterprise assistants
✔ Research assistants
✔ PDF chatbots

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔧 Best Practices

✔ Use prompt templates for consistency
✔ Limit memory size to reduce token cost
✔ Combine memory with retrieval carefully
✔ Store citations in responses

---

⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Very long chat history
❌ Poor prompt structure
❌ No retrieval grounding
❌ Memory overload

---

🧠 Interview Answer (Simple)

> Prompt templates create reusable prompts, memory enables multi-turn conversations, and Conversational RetrievalQA combines retrieval with conversation history for context-aware chatbot responses.

